# The extension app reads nothing secret. Everything here is a public
# build-time value, inlined into the bundle by Vite — never put a secret in it.
#
# The defaults live in the committed `.env.development` and `.env.production`,
# so a fresh clone needs no setup. Copy this file to `.env.local` only to point
# at some other website; `.env.local` wins over both and is never committed.

# Where the website lives: posts are read there and accounts live there.
# Must be an absolute http(s) URL — the build fails otherwise.
VITE_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"
